  "notes": [
    "Header is on the back of the board; pin 1 (BAT) is at the top-left when you look at the back with the USB-C port on the left.",
    "GPIO1, 2, 3, 5 (LCD SPI) and 6 (backlight), 12-16 (audio) are used on the board and not on the header.",
    "GPIO9/10/11 are free only without a TF card; the camera-shared pins are free only without a camera.",
    "NEAR Checkout uses no external parts: display, touch and USB only."
